   "like_count": 7,
   "cooked": "<p>One of the ideas we had on the unconference with Dan, Griff, Nate, Juan, Mich, Mateo and Theodor it’s to get market data on our bonding curve using Dune  Analytics and also provide a transparency report every 6 months on the movements of the funds from our common pool (on a spreadsheet with graphics). And get some statistics on how we are using those funds, how much we are destinating on projects, every WG, etc. I think sharing this information on a visual way will improve our transparency on funds management even if the information its available itself on the blockchain</p>\n<p>The goal with this post is to reach a broader quorum and have a deeper discussion on this topic and discuss other tools around. Probably we don’t need to do a vote unless someone asks for it</p>\n<p>SME: <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ygg_anderson\">@ygg_anderson</a></p>",
